{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46842","headline":"酬荅退上人 · 齐己","name":"酬荅退上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"须鬓三分白二分，一生踪迹出人羣。\n嵩丘梦忆诸峰雪，衡岳禅依五寺云。\n青衲几临高瀑濯，苦吟曾许断猿闻。\n荒村残腊相逢夜，月满鸿多楚水濆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}